# Manual API checks – Rider: run the API with the "https" profile, then click ▶ next to a request.
# Rider's HTTP client keeps cookies between requests, like a browser.

@host = https://localhost:7283

### Public – is the API alive?
GET {{host}}/health

### Not signed in yet → 401
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Sign in as a persona (dev only). "private" = your own data from the Worker (dev:private)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev/private

### Who am I? → id, provider "dev", name
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Sign out
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### After sign-out → 401 again
GET {{host}}/api/me

### ---------- 5b: my jobs (sign in first) ----------
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev/private

### Open jobs (evaluated + waiting), best first, with counts for every tab
GET {{host}}/api/matches

### Other tabs: InProgress, Closed, TriagedOut
GET {{host}}/api/matches?view=triagedout

### Detail – paste an id from the list
@matchId = 01a1167f-e213-7f0c-9383-59ee8887ba83
GET {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}

### Change status (New, SavedForLater, Applied, Call, Round1, Round2, Offer, Rejected, Withdrawn, Dismissed, Hidden)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SavedForLater", "note": "Vyzkoušení z Rideru" }

### Notes
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Zeptat se na podíl home office" }

### ---------- 5c: on demand (costs a few cents each – real Claude!) ----------
### Evaluate any job of mine (waiting, triaged out, or again)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/evaluate

### Write a letter for an evaluated job (409 if one exists → add ?replace=true)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/letter

### Edit the letter
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/letter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Dobrý den,\n\nupravený dopis…" }

### ---------- 5d: my profile ----------
### Sign in as a throw-away persona first – uploading the sample CV as "private" would replace YOUR profile
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev/jana-api

### Empty profile at first
GET {{host}}/api/profile

### Upload a CV (real Claude analysis ≈ $0.03 when the file or notes changed). Path relative to this file.
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/cv
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=cv

--cv
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../JobScout.Worker/samples/cv.md
--cv--

### Notes → re-analysis with the stored CV
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Nejdůležitější je pro mě práce z domova." }

### Grammatical gender for cover letters: Unspecified, Masculine, Feminine
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gender": "Masculine" }
